# Westerly Winds' 3027 finish with a full bag (fill-inventory): nothing is given, status stays 0 (still 3027 on the
# area); room again: the note, the piece, the title, status 1. 3028 finished at once on a completion that fails (a
# full bag at the Silver Piece reward: the mission stays current, the note stays).
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/5 AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3027 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3028
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=80,-6,-140 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau WesterlyWinds current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
fill-inventory                          # a GM
walk 80,-6,-130                         # area 5: 3027
finish                                  # no room: nothing, status 0
free-inventory                          # a GM
walk 80,-6,-140
walk 80,-6,-130                         # 3027 again
finish                                  # given, status 1
fill-inventory                          # a GM: a full bag
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3028
finish                                  # the completion fails for the full bag
free-inventory
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3028
finish                                  # completed
